SUMMARY:The Data Stewards Master Class with Stefaan Verhulst
LOCATION:unlimitrust campus\, Prilly (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:A limited-places afternoon master class on data stewardship —
  who holds responsibility for data being shared\, and how to organise that
  in practice — held the day before the Swiss Data Space Forum and closin
 g with a networking apéro.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Data Alliance / digitalswi
 tzerland\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/da
 ta-stewards-master-class-prilly-2026/
